@startuml US062_SSD
title US062 - List Collaborators of an Air Transport Company - SSD

actor "Backoffice Operator" as Operator
participant "SEM4PI Backoffice System" as System

Operator -> System : request to list collaborators of an Air Transport Company
System --> Operator : ask for company ICAO code

Operator -> System : provide ICAO code
System --> Operator : present list of active collaborators (username, first name, last name, email)

alt company not found
    System --> Operator : show error (company not found)
else no active collaborators
    System --> Operator : present empty list
else not authenticated / not authorized
    System --> Operator : show access denied message
end

@enduml
